      "note": "Dolma 3 Longmino pool: one folder per topic and length bucket, data/olmocr_science_pdfs-<topic>-2e<k>/ with k = 13 (8-16k tokens of their tokenizer), 14 (16-32k), 15 (32-64k), 16 (64-128k), 17 (128-256k), 18 (256-512k), 19, 20. Two topics; half of the tokens from the 16-64k buckets, half from the 64-512k buckets; the folders of a part are read one file each in turn.",
      "parts": [
        {
          "label": "16-64k",
          "share": 0.5,
          "files": [
